    s 1s "……啊哈哈！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:620
translate chinese ch2_end_a1548a53:

    # s 4s "Sorry, I giggled..."
    s 4s "抱歉，我笑场了……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:621
translate chinese ch2_end_5b525ad4:

    # s 4q "Ehehe..."
    s 4q "诶嘿嘿……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:622
translate chinese ch2_end_e87e0575:

    # mc "Sayori..."
    mc "纱世里……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:623
translate chinese ch2_end_5b98b763:

    # s 1l "It's a lot harder than I thought!"
    s 1l "这比想象中难多了！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:624
translate chinese ch2_end_69e30928:

    # s "How did you guys do it so easily?"
    s "为什么你们都能念得那么顺？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:627
translate chinese ch2_end_f0139694:

    # m "Ah..."
    m "啊……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:628
translate chinese ch2_end_79faa99a:

    # m "Try not to think of it like you're reciting to other people."
    m "试着别把它当成念给别人听。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:629
translate chinese ch2_end_0392ea6c:

    # m "Imagine you're reciting it to yourself, like in front of a mirror, or in your own head."
    m "想象你是在念给自己听，就像对着镜子，或者在自己心里默念一样。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:630
translate chinese ch2_end_73e6566a:

    # m "It's your poem, so it'll come out the best that way."
    m "那是你自己的诗，这样才最能念出它的味道。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:632
translate chinese ch2_end_eda8c9b0:

    # s "I see, I see..."
    s "原来如此，原来如此……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:633
translate chinese ch2_end_899ef0e3:

    # s "Okay, then..."
    s "那么，再来……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:637
translate chinese ch2_end_43a19f01:

    # "Sayori begins her poem."
    "纱世里开始了她的朗诵。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:638
translate chinese ch2_end_281ecfa4:

    # "Somehow, it feels like her soft voice was made as a perfect match."
    "不知为何，她轻柔的嗓音仿佛天生就与这首诗相配。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:639
translate chinese ch2_end_3c3af200:

    # "The poem isn't aimlessly cheery like Sayori is."
    "这首诗并不像纱世里本人那样没心没肺地欢快。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:640
translate chinese ch2_end_3cd91d22:

    # "It's serene and bittersweet."
    "它宁静，又带着一丝苦涩。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:641
translate chinese ch2_end_ab263d04:

    # "If I were to read this on paper, I probably wouldn't think much of it..."
    "如果只是看纸面上的文字，我大概不会有什么感触……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:642
translate chinese ch2_end_5aab9ff6:

    # "But hearing it come from Sayori's voice almost gives it a whole new meaning."
    "可经由纱世里的声音念出来，它几乎被赋予了全新的意义。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:643
translate chinese ch2_end_aa8b528e:

    # "Maybe this is what Sayori meant when she said she likes my poems."
    "也许这就是纱世里说她喜欢我的诗时，想表达的意思。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:644
translate chinese ch2_end_9eba53fd:

    # "It's like I get to reach more deeply into someone I thought I knew through and through."
    "就像伸出手，触到了一个自以为早已了如指掌的人更深的内里。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:645
translate chinese ch2_end_8dec374a:

    # "Sayori finishes, and we applaud."
    "纱世里念完了，我们报以掌声。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:646
translate chinese ch2_end_a0f04fa2:

    # s 3q "I did it~!"
    s 3q "成功啦~！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:647
translate chinese ch2_end_261147aa:

    # mc "Good job, Sayori."
    mc "干得好，纱世里。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:648
translate chinese ch2_end_e21292e5:

    # s "Ehehe, even [player] liked it."
    s "诶嘿嘿，连[player]都觉得好呢。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:649
translate chinese ch2_end_1a34bc11:

    # s "I guess that's a good sign~"
    s "看来是个好兆头~"

# script-ch2.rpyc:650
translate chinese ch2_end_d671595a:

    # mc "What does that even mean...?"
    mc "这话到底什么意思……？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:652
translate chinese ch2_end_179a3566:

    # m "It came out nicely, Sayori."
    m "朗诵得很不错，纱世里。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:653
translate chinese ch2_end_ef36a575:

    # m "The atmosphere of the poem fits you really nicely."
    m "这首诗的意境和你的声音非常契合。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:654
translate chinese ch2_end_3be3ea41:

    # m "But it might be that other poems wouldn't work quite as well with that kind of delivery..."
    m "不过换个别的诗，这种轻柔的念法可能就不那么合适了……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:657
translate chinese ch2_end_4ec31a64:

    # s 1g "Eh? I don't really understand..."
    s 1g "诶？我不太明白……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:660
translate chinese ch2_end_1c8e6eaf:

    # m 1a "In other words, I've seen poems of yours where that sort of gentle delivery wouldn't work as well."
    m 1a "这么说吧，我看过你写的另一些诗，它们就不适合用这种轻柔的方式来念。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:661
translate chinese ch2_end_39bad68c:

    # m "They might need a little more force behind them, depending on what you're reading..."
    m "根据内容的不同，有些诗需要更有力量地念出来……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:664
translate chinese ch2_end_e57fbe56:

    # s 1x "Oh, I know what you mean!"
    s 1x "啊，我懂你的意思！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:665
translate chinese ch2_end_ce75194e:

    # s "That's...well, I've been practicing that kind of thing..."
    s "那个……其实，我也一直在练那一类的东西……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:666
translate chinese ch2_end_3312af78:

    # s 5 "It's just embarrassing to do in front of everyone..."
    s 5 "只是当着大家的面做，实在太难为情了……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:667
translate chinese ch2_end_cc3db8cd:

    # s "Ehehe..."
    s "诶嘿嘿……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:670
translate chinese ch2_end_9c52d6fe:

    # m 4a "Then next time, I'm going to make you pick a poem that challenges you a little more."
    m 4a "那下次，我可要让你挑一首更有挑战性的诗了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:671
translate chinese ch2_end_d03cf0f1:

    # m "We don't have much time before the festival, you know?"
    m "离学园祭只剩没几天了哦？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:674
translate chinese ch2_end_dbce585d:

    # s 1q "Okaaaaay."
    s 1q "好~啦好~啦。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:677
translate chinese ch2_end_dad84ae8:

    # m 1a "Now, who's next...?"
    m 1a "那么，下一位是……？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:678
translate chinese ch2_end_e0540e08:

    # m "Natsuki?"
    m "夏树？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:681
translate chinese ch2_end_ffa2b290:

    # n "Hmph."
    n "哼。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:682
translate chinese ch2_end_61d3b26b:

    # n "Don't make me go before [player]."
    n "别让我排在[player]前面。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:683
translate chinese ch2_end_321d5396:

    # n "It's not like I can compare to you guys, anyway..."
    n "反正我也比不过你们就是了……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:684
translate chinese ch2_end_6039c06b:

    # n "Might as well let [player] lower everyone's standards a little before I have to do it."
    n "不如先让[player]把大家的标准拉低一点，我再上。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:687
translate chinese ch2_end_75d5f6d1:

    # s 1g "Natsuki..."
    s 1g "夏树……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:689
translate chinese ch2_end_4255537f:

    # mc "It's fine, it's fine."
    mc "行行行。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:690
translate chinese ch2_end_e026ba26:

    # mc "I might as well get it over with."
    mc "我也索性长痛不如短痛。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:691
translate chinese ch2_end_5c9a9693:

    # mc "But it's not like I have much of a selection of what to read..."
    mc "不过我也没什么可选的余地……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:692
translate chinese ch2_end_f92b6256:

    # mc "I'll just have to go with what I wrote for today."
    mc "只能拿今天带来的这首凑数了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:693
translate chinese ch2_end_a275dbee:

    # "I stand up and step in front of the podium."
    "我起身走到讲台前。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:698
translate chinese ch2_end_b50ceaed:

    # "Everyone has their eyes on me, making me feel terribly awkward."
    "所有人的目光都集中在我身上，弄得我浑身不自在。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:699
translate chinese ch2_end_ec8f99a2:

    # "I recite my poem."
    "我开始朗诵自己的诗。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:700
translate chinese ch2_end_9eff646e:

    # "Since I'm not exactly confident in my own writing, it's hard to put energy into it."
    "毕竟对自己的文笔没什么自信，实在很难念出气势。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:701
translate chinese ch2_end_c19a5d45:

    # "Despite that, once I finish, I receive applause anyway."
    "尽管如此，念完之后，大家还是给了我掌声。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:702
translate chinese ch2_end_68a8daa2:

    # mc "Sorry I'm not really as good as everyone else..."
    mc "抱歉，我实在是比不上大家……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:704
translate chinese ch2_end_adf9b0fc:

    # m 1a "Don't worry about it so much."
    m 1a "别太在意。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:705
translate chinese ch2_end_c8ab5943:

    # m "I think it's less about your abilities, and more about your lack of confidence in your writing."
    m "我觉得问题不在能力，而是你对自己的文字缺乏自信。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:706
translate chinese ch2_end_443126e0:

    # m "That's something that'll improve over time, though."
    m "不过，这会随着时间慢慢改善的。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:708
translate chinese ch2_end_def332e9:

    # mc "Yeah... Maybe."
    mc "嗯……但愿吧。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:710
translate chinese ch2_end_7e71afb1:

    # m 1j "Alright, then!"
    m 1j "好，那么！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:711
translate chinese ch2_end_e987b77e:

    # m 1a "That just leaves you, Natsuki."
    m 1a "最后就只剩你了，夏树。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:714
translate chinese ch2_end_9ff8dc31:

    # n 2g "Yeah, yeah."
    n 2g "行行。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:715
translate chinese ch2_end_2fee7809:

    # n "I'm going."
    n "这就来。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:716
translate chinese ch2_end_87b6c508:

    # "Natsuki begrudgingly gets out of her seat and makes her way to the podium."
    "夏树老大不情愿地从座位上起身，磨磨蹭蹭地走向讲台。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:724
translate chinese ch2_end_090057a7:

    # n 2c "The poem is called..."
    n 2c "这首诗的题目是……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:725
translate chinese ch2_end_593d0813:

    # n 2q "It's called..."
    n 2q "叫作……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:726
translate chinese ch2_end_d9ecd5da:

    # n 1x "W-Why are you all looking at me?!"
    n 1x "你、你们都盯着我干什么？！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:727
translate chinese ch2_end_4a718c10:

    # m "Because you're presenting..."
    m "因为现在是你在台上啊……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:728
translate chinese ch2_end_ea4b9ca5:

    # n 2x "Hmph..."
    n 2x "哼……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:729
translate chinese ch2_end_bde029d8:

    # n 2h "Anyway...the poem is called {i}Jump{/i}."
    n 2h "总、总之……这首诗叫{i}《跳跃》{/i}。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:730
translate chinese ch2_end_700fd121:

    # "Natsuki takes a breath."
    "夏树吸了一口气。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:732
translate chinese ch2_end_5e2b7947:

    # "Once she starts reciting the poem, her sour attitude disappears a little."
    "一开始朗诵，她那股别扭劲儿便消退了几分。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:733
translate chinese ch2_end_0b371622:

    # "While she's still a little unenthused, her poem has a rhythm and rhyme to it."
    "虽然还是提不起劲的样子，但她的诗自带节奏与韵律。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:734
translate chinese ch2_end_9e4e82d2:

    # "It's Natsuki's trademark style, and it works surprisingly well when spoken aloud."
    "这正是夏树的招牌风格，朗读出来的效果出乎意料地好。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:735
translate chinese ch2_end_512493a0:

    # "The words feel like they bounce up and down, as if giving life to the poem."
    "字句仿佛在纸面上蹦蹦跳跳，赋予了诗歌生命。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:737
translate chinese ch2_end_aa8fca9d:

    # "Natsuki finishes, and everyone applauds."
    "夏树念完，大家一起鼓掌。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:738
translate chinese ch2_end_eee35b2e:

    # "She huffs back to her seat."
    "她气鼓鼓地回到座位上。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:740
translate chinese ch2_end_3ba3e312:

    # m "That wasn't so bad, was it?"
    m "也没那么可怕吧？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:743
translate chinese ch2_end_c512e9c0:

    # n "Easy for you to say..."
    n "你倒是说得轻巧……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:744
translate chinese ch2_end_fe106c88:

    # n "You'd better not make me do that again."
    n "你最好别再让我来第二次。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:747
translate chinese ch2_end_7fee0771:

    # m "Ah, well..."
    m "啊，这个嘛……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:748
translate chinese ch2_end_76822100:

    # m "Do you at least feel prepared enough to recite a poem in front of other people?"
    m "至少现在，你有信心在别人面前朗诵了吗？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:751
translate chinese ch2_end_0a20ee75:

    # n "I mean, doing it in front of other people will be way easier!"
    n "这么说吧，在外人面前反而轻松多了！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:752
translate chinese ch2_end_23cc3e2e:

    # n "I can put on whatever face I want for other people."
    n "面对外人，我可以随意摆出任何一副面孔。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:753
translate chinese ch2_end_b3a4b9d7:

    # n 2q "But when it's just my friends..."
    n 2q "可要是面对的都是朋友……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:754
translate chinese ch2_end_4ffc8529:

    # n "It's just...embarrassing."
    n "就……太难为情了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:757
translate chinese ch2_end_19ab6ffc:

    # s "That's a surprise, Natsuki..."
    s "真意外啊，夏树……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:758
translate chinese ch2_end_aadf171f:

    # s "I think it would be the other way around for me."
    s "换成我的话，肯定正好相反。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:761
translate chinese ch2_end_edf87759:

    # n "Well, that's just how it is, so..."
    n "总之，就是这么回事，所以……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:764
translate chinese ch2_end_10afa9a2:

    # m 1a "Well, I guess in that case..."
    m 1a "嗯，这样的话……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:765
translate chinese ch2_end_9e9d3412:

    # m "You won't have much to worry about for the festival."
    m "学园祭那天，你就没什么好担心的了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:766
translate chinese ch2_end_98975268:

    # m 2b "That said, I want to thank everyone for coming through."
    m 2b "话说回来，谢谢大家能挺过来。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:767
translate chinese ch2_end_0499da0d:

    # m "It might be hard, but I hope that you all have an idea of what it's like now."
    m "虽然不容易，但希望大家现在心里都有底了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:768
translate chinese ch2_end_7e15372d:

    # m 4b "Make sure you pick a poem and get enough practice before the festival, okay?"
    m 4b "记得在学园祭之前选好诗，练到位，好吗？"

# script-ch2.rpyc:769
translate chinese ch2_end_1cd2ad86:

    # m "I'll be making pamphlets, so let me know ahead of time what you'll be reciting."
    m "我还要做宣传册，你们要朗诵什么，提前告诉我一声。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:771
translate chinese ch2_end_9098da49:

    # mc "Jeez..."
    mc "唉……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:772
translate chinese ch2_end_3e1a4f76:

    # mc "I should probably find some other poem to recite instead."
    mc "我大概还是另找一首别的诗来朗诵吧。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:774
translate chinese ch2_end_c3ea60f0:

    # m 1j "That's fine, too!"
    m 1j "那也没问题！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:775
translate chinese ch2_end_fbfe401d:

    # m 1a "It doesn't have to be your own."
    m 1a "不一定非得是自己写的。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:776
translate chinese ch2_end_59b9c4f6:

    # m "I'm already pleasantly surprised that you're putting in all this effort for the club."
    m "你愿意为社团付出这么多，我已经喜出望外了。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:777
translate chinese ch2_end_80757a6d:

    # m 5 "It makes me really happy."
    m 5 "这让我真的很开心。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:779
translate chinese ch2_end_ab593820:

    # mc "Ah... Yeah, no problem..."
    mc "啊……嗯，没什么……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:786
translate chinese ch2_end_215e00ed:

    # m 4b "Okay, everyone!"
    m 4b "好了，各位！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:787
translate chinese ch2_end_d9a605b0:

    # m "I think that's about it for today."
    m "今天的活动就到这里啦。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:788
translate chinese ch2_end_b1232a1f:

    # m "I know the festival is coming up, but let's try to write poems for tomorrow, as well."
    m "虽然学园祭临近，但明天的诗也请照常写哦。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:789
translate chinese ch2_end_a464a3cc:

    # m "It's been working out really nicely so far, so I'd like to continue that."
    m "到目前为止效果一直很好，我想把这个传统继续下去。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:790
translate chinese ch2_end_8bc47b65:

    # m "As for the festival, we'll finish planning tomorrow, and then we'll have the weekend to prepare."
    m "至于学园祭，明天敲定最后的方案，周末用来准备。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:791
translate chinese ch2_end_dd8b9fcf:

    # m "Monday's the big day!"
    m "周一就是大日子了！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:793
translate chinese ch2_end_ebf4c7a9:

    # s "I can't wait~!"
    s "等不及啦~！"

# script-ch2.rpyc:795
translate chinese ch2_end_03a54bb7:

    # y "I can do this... I can do this..."
    y "我能做到……我能做到……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:796
translate chinese ch2_end_506f5ac0:

    # mc "Alright--"
    mc "好了——"

# script-ch2.rpyc:801
translate chinese ch2_end_1950528a:

    # "I stand up."
    "我站起身。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:802
translate chinese ch2_end_5b4208e2:

    # "There's no way I'll be able to find the same enthusiasm as Sayori and Monika, but I'll do my best to get through it."
    "我是不可能拿出纱世里和莫妮卡那样的热情了，但我会尽力撑过去。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:803
translate chinese ch2_end_0919e951:

    # "If it's for the sake of the club..."
    "如果是为了社团……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:804
translate chinese ch2_end_eaf848d9:

    # "And impressing Monika..."
    "也为了让莫妮卡刮目相看……"

# script-ch2.rpyc:805
translate chinese ch2_end_ce44a035:

    # "Then I'll have to do my best."
    "那就必须全力以赴。"

# script-ch2.rpyc:807
translate chinese ch2_end_086c5ef4:

